{"4318680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Light your Way", "steam_appid": 4318680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4397750], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wake up! You are ready to be born, a deep journey awaits you.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&gt; Light up your path</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s only you and a destination to reach in what appears to be an empty space.<br>Hidden platforms reveal themselves only when you stand on them or when you hit them with a <strong>mysterious ball</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318680/extras/3da3360409698b4505aa727a2dcafe94.poster.avif?t=1772731702\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318680/extras/3da3360409698b4505aa727a2dcafe94.webm?t=1772731702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318680/extras/3da3360409698b4505aa727a2dcafe94.mp4?t=1772731702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&gt; Manipulate special platforms and overcome the obstacles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your journey unfolds, new types of platforms will emerge, each with a distinct purpose. <br>Master them to move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318680/extras/e36189b9bd6c70d560c3c0cb17b60422.poster.avif?t=1772731702\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318680/extras/e36189b9bd6c70d560c3c0cb17b60422.webm?t=1772731702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318680/extras/e36189b9bd6c70d560c3c0cb17b60422.mp4?t=1772731702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318680/extras/788ddb8a4d3bb9c07f8722a9ae1770eb.poster.avif?t=1772731702\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318680/extras/788ddb8a4d3bb9c07f8722a9ae1770eb.webm?t=1772731702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318680/extras/788ddb8a4d3bb9c07f8722a9ae1770eb.mp4?t=1772731702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But platforms aren’t the only challenge. New obstacles will reshape your understanding of the game and force you to adapt.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318680/extras/d0b45c5c21c443b83abacad8d5610303.poster.avif?t=1772731702\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318680/extras/d0b45c5c21c443b83abacad8d5610303.webm?t=1772731702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318680/extras/d0b45c5c21c443b83abacad8d5610303.mp4?t=1772731702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&gt; Dive in the mind of the character</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each world represents a stage of the character’s journey, expressed through poetic narration.<br>Existential questions emerge: will you be able to answer them?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wake up! You are ready to be born, a deep journey awaits you.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&gt; Light up your path</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s only you and a destination to reach in what appears to be an empty space.<br>Hidden platforms reveal themselves only when you stand on them or when you hit them with a <strong>mysterious ball</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318680/extras/3da3360409698b4505aa727a2dcafe94.poster.avif?t=1772731702\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318680/extras/3da3360409698b4505aa727a2dcafe94.webm?t=1772731702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318680/extras/3da3360409698b4505aa727a2dcafe94.mp4?t=1772731702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&gt; Manipulate special platforms and overcome the obstacles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your journey unfolds, new types of platforms will emerge, each with a distinct purpose. <br>Master them to move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318680/extras/e36189b9bd6c70d560c3c0cb17b60422.poster.avif?t=1772731702\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318680/extras/e36189b9bd6c70d560c3c0cb17b60422.webm?t=1772731702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318680/extras/e36189b9bd6c70d560c3c0cb17b60422.mp4?t=1772731702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318680/extras/788ddb8a4d3bb9c07f8722a9ae1770eb.poster.avif?t=1772731702\" width=1170 height=366 >